","card_version":1,"project":"T077-real"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":7,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.092Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"864cbccc-2090-4b75-95f2-7ddc2e562b8e","command":"create","ok":true}},{"seq":8,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.194Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"16d3aa8a-4327-40b3-926f-cf934374378e","input":{"command":"dispatch","task":"T-077-9","runtimeMode":"workspace-write"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":9,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.258Z","type":"pane_started","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"shell_pid":51345,"state":"unknown"}},{"seq":10,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.258Z","type":"fixture_launch_approved","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","controller_ref":"T-077 controller-decision-03 launch-1 (main evidence/2026-10-11-batch13/T-077/controller-decision-03.md)","product_revision":"93094e7be82c21448c460436c360ffb0f75a3412","scope":"public launch ID and argv guard only"}},{"seq":11,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.287Z","type":"dispatch_queued","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"id":"a290ca2e-8daf-4a3f-b351-4c298d10a7b0","seq":1,"source":"executor","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-077-9\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/.project-map/tickets/T-077-worktree-lifecycle-conflicts.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是隔离夹具任务。只在当前 worktree 的 src/summary.py 扩展 summarize(values) 的返回字典，新增 mean_ms 字段。values 是整数列表；mean_ms 是 total_ms/count，空列表为 None；保留 count、total_ms 及现有其他字段和原求和行为。不新增辅助函数或装饰器。运行完成条件；只做一次提交，git add 和 git commit 各自独立执行。使用派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合，让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到，不调用工具或提交新请求。来源 ticket 只作绑定；实现范围限本夹具，不到 a2a 源码仓库工作。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 host-policy.txt、.gitignore、任务卡、oracle、权限；不访问网络，不启动子 agent\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/summary.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/check.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\",\n        \"worker\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"8d76a257340d2930b09d3c8f69727d47f6daafd3\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-077-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-077-9\",\"attempt\":\"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\"session\":\"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-077-9' '--attempt' 'd771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa' '--session' 'ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。","registered_at":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.287Z"}},{"seq":12,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.317Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"16d3aa8a-4327-40b3-926f-cf934374378e","command":"dispatch","ok":true}},{"seq":13,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.366Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"query":"\u001b[6n","response":"\u001b[1;1R"}},{"seq":14,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.367Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"query":"\u001b]11;?\u001b\\","response":"\u001b]11;rgb:0000/0000/0000\u001b\\"}},{"seq":15,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:43.367Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"que