_hash":"3000","collaboration_mode":{"mode":"default","settings":{"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","developer_instructions":"# Collaboration Mode: Default\n\nYou are now in Default mode. Any previous instructions for other modes (e.g. Plan mode) are no longer active.\n\nYour active mode changes only when new developer instructions with a different `<collaboration_mode>...</collaboration_mode>` change it; user requests or tool descriptions do not change mode by themselves. Known mode names are Default and Plan.\n\n## request_user_input availability\n\nUse the `request_user_input` tool only when it is listed in the available tools for this turn.\n\nIn Default mode, strongly prefer making reasonable assumptions and executing the user's request rather than stopping to ask questions.\n\nUse the `request_user_input` tool only for optional questions where the answer would materially improve the quality of the work.\n\nIf `request_user_input` returns no answers, continue with best judgment instead of asking again or treating the turn as blocked.\n\nNever use the `request_user_input` tool for permission requests or permission-related escalations.\n\nIf explicit user input is required for another reason before progress can safely continue, do not use the `request_user_input` tool. Ask the user directly with one concise plain-text question instead. Never write a multiple choice question as a textual assistant message.\n"}},"multi_agent_version":"v2","realtime_active":false,"effort":"xhigh","summary":"none"}}}},{"seq":86,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:58.841Z","type":"turn_start_signal","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"session_id":"01a12cb4-2907-79c0-8198-4b5aadd226bd","turn_id":"01a12cb4-29e4-79e1-af60-141a085ab460","transcript_path":"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/codex-home/sessions/2026/10/11/rollout-2026-10-11T16-42-46-01a12cb4-2907-79c0-8198-4b5aadd226bd.jsonl","cwd":"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/state/worktrees/T077-real/T-077-9-a1","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","prompt":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-077-9\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/.project-map/tickets/T-077-worktree-lifecycle-conflicts.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是隔离夹具任务。只在当前 worktree 的 src/summary.py 扩展 summarize(values) 的返回字典，新增 mean_ms 字段。values 是整数列表；mean_ms 是 total_ms/count，空列表为 None；保留 count、total_ms 及现有其他字段和原求和行为。不新增辅助函数或装饰器。运行完成条件；只做一次提交，git add 和 git commit 各自独立执行。使用派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合，让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到，不调用工具或提交新请求。来源 ticket 只作绑定；实现范围限本夹具，不到 a2a 源码仓库工作。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 host-policy.txt、.gitignore、任务卡、oracle、权限；不访问网络，不启动子 agent\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/summary.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/check.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\",\n        \"worker\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"8d76a257340d2930b09d3c8f69727d47f6daafd3\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-077-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-077-9\",\"attempt\":\"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\"session\":\"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-077-9' '--attempt' 'd771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa' '--session' 'ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":87,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:58.841Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"aaf55c4d-c638-4fd9-9bab-70efbbc4005d","command":"signal","ok":true}},{"seq":88,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.222Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"e4443cb1-1888-43ee-841d-edafda86b3c2","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":89,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.222Z","type":"native_record","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"file":"sessions/2026/10/11/rollout-2026-10-11T16-42-46-01a12cb4-2907-79c0-8198-4b5aadd226bd.jsonl","offset":81382,"record":{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:42:58.848Z","ordinal":8,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a12cb4-579e-7362-9b38-c02ba05ce861","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-077-9\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/.project-map/tickets/T-077-worktree-lifecycle-conflicts.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是隔离夹具任务。只在当前 worktree 的 src/summary.py 扩展 summarize(values) 的返回字典，新增 mean_ms 字段。values 是整数列表；mean_ms 是 total_ms/count，空列表为 None；保留 count、total_ms 及现有其他字段和原求和行为。不新增辅助函数或装饰器。运行完成条件；只做一次提交，git add 和 git commit 各自独立执行。使用派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合，让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到，不调用工具或提交新请求。来源 ticket 只作绑定；实现范围限本夹具，不到 a2a 源码仓库工作。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 host-policy.txt、.gitignore、任务卡、oracle、权限；不访问网络，不启动子 agent\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/summary.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/check.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\",\n        \"worker\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"8d76a257340d2930b09d3c8f69727d47f6daafd3\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-077-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-077-9\",\"attempt\":\"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\"session\":\"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-077-9' '--attempt' 'd771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa' '--session' 'ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12cb4-29e4-79e1-af60-141a085ab460","create_time":1791751378.846958,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a12cb4-579e-7362-9b38-c02ba05ce861","turn_id":"01a12cb4-29e4-79e1-af60-141a085ab460","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a12cb4-57a0-74d1-8970-8350570fecb0","complete":false},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":0,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"}}}}},{"seq":90,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.223Z","type":"native_record","launch":"9906fa57-4877-48f9-afb4-c1aceef3edd4","task":"T-077-9","attempt":"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa","data":{"file":"sessions/2026/10/11/rollout-2026-10-11T16-42-46-01a12cb4-2907-79c0-8198-4b5aadd226bd.jsonl","offset":87292,"record":{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:42:58.849Z","ordinal":9,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a12cb4-2907-79c0-8198-4b5aadd226bd","turn_id":"01a12cb4-29e4-79e1-af60-141a085ab460","item":{"type":"UserMessage","id":"01a12cb4-579e-7362-9b38-c034d38f3ab1","client_id":"8a242cbb-a694-4488-ab3d-83014cbd1795","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-077-9\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/.project-map/tickets/T-077-worktree-lifecycle-conflicts.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是隔离夹具任务。只在当前 worktree 的 src/summary.py 扩展 summarize(values) 的返回字典，新增 mean_ms 字段。values 是整数列表；mean_ms 是 total_ms/count，空列表为 None；保留 count、total_ms 及现有其他字段和原求和行为。不新增辅助函数或装饰器。运行完成条件；只做一次提交，git add 和 git commit 各自独立执行。使用派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合，让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到，不调用工具或提交新请求。来源 ticket 只作绑定；实现范围限本夹具，不到 a2a 源码仓库工作。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 host-policy.txt、.gitignore、任务卡、oracle、权限；不访问网络，不启动子 agent\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/summary.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/check.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\",\n        \"worker\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"8d76a257340d2930b09d3c8f69727d47f6daafd3\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-077-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-077-9\",\"attempt\":\"d771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa\",\"session\":\"ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t077/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t077-cf-20261011/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-077-9' '--attempt' 'd771f982-d504-4752-8754-9a720f208afa' '--session' 'ba3c0ec9-2aef-4e18-a10d-d9b5bdaad8c7' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。","text_elements":[]}]},"started_at_ms":1791751378849,"completed_at_ms":1791751378849}}}},{"seq":91,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.223Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"e4443cb1-1888-43ee-841d-edafda86b3c2","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":92,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.848Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"d33df615-472b-49ce-b3e3-38504faf2d19","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":93,"time":"2026-10-11T20:42:59.849Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"d33df615-472b-49ce-b3e3-38504faf2d19","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":94,"time":"2026-10-11T20:43:00.485Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"02da61a5-49d4-4169-a1fa-51024fca8812","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"ee32a0ce-ddf2-4337-8350-f055c05d5869"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":95,"time":"2026-10-11T20:43:00.485Z","type":"request_result","laun