e as a standalone Markdown file, only if the user did not explicitly request a Markdown file. Honor established formats, destinations, and repository d (file: r2/write-page/SKILL.md)\n- plugin-management:plugin-management: Discover and suggest relevant plugins, inspect app permissions and dependencies, and manage plugin connections or removal. Use when the user asks about plugins or when a task would materially benefit from an external app, account, service, or data (file: r3/plugin-management/0.1.0/skills/plugin-management/SKILL.md)\n- project-map: Keep a long-running project's destination, decisions, open tickets, glossary, and key living docs in a small local-markdown map under `.project-map/`, carry the work from decisions to a spec, tracer-bullet build tickets, and one ticket per sess (file: r0/project-map/SKILL.md)\n- reality-first-engineering: Establish a short, evidence-backed decision gate before architecture or broad implementation when missing facts, requirements, external behavior, or acceptance criteria could change the direction. Use only for consequential or materially uncert (file: r0/reality-first-engineering/SKILL.md)\n- remove-ai-marks: Remove multi-vendor AI provenance marks: invisible Unicode (Layer A), statistical text watermarks via rewrite (Layer B, always offer), and C2PA/EXIF/XMP/container metadata on PNG/JPEG/WebP/SVG/PDF/DOCX/ODT/HTML/MD. Covers Claude, Gemini/SynthID (file: r0/remove-ai-marks/SKILL.md)\n- review-animations: Reviews animation and motion code against a high craft bar derived from Emil Kowalski's design engineering philosophy. Default to flagging; approval is earned. (file: r0/review-animations/SKILL.md)\n- same-visual-family: Keeps composed UI in the current visual system after the look is already chosen. Use when assembling or reviewing sections from multiple templates, kits, or reference sites, or when the user says 拼装, 每块不像一家, frankenstein, or wants to move a refer (file: r0/same-visual-family/SKILL.md)\n- sites:sites: 